{"evidence":["`crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs:553-568` computes CO2 exchange from carbonate-solved current CO2, Henry's law atmospheric equilibrium, and `compute_o2_kla(state) * 0.91`, so CO2 is coupled to the same K_LA basis as dissolved oxygen.","`crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs:587-591` reapplies carbonate equilibrium immediately after DIC changes, so CO2 stripping propagates into bicarbonate and pH updates in the same hourly chemistry step.","`cargo test -q --test co2_exchange` passed: 12/12 tests green, including 24h stripping toward equilibrium, passive-vs-aerated exchange, temperature dependence, volume-independence under the K_LA model, shared-basis proportionality, and aeration-driven pH rise.","`cargo test -q --test chemistry` passed: 21/21 tests green, covering carbonate solver behavior and pH stability/regression cases.","`cargo test -q --test dissolved_oxygen` passed: 5/5 tests green, giving regression coverage on the shared O2 K_LA path used by CO2 exchange."],"findings_or_gaps":["No task-specific correctness or completeness issue was found in the CO2 gas-exchange implementation after code review and targeted validation.","Validation gap: the implementation-stage claim that `cargo clippy` was clean is not reproducible from the current checkout. `cargo clippy -q -p tank_core --tests -- -D warnings` currently fails on an unrelated unused import at `crates/tank_core/tests/shrimp_population.rs:5`.","Broader repo health is still not fully green: `cargo test -q -p tank_core` currently fails in unrelated test `trim_plants_is_closed_system_via_helpers` from `crates/tank_core/src/budget_helpers.rs:461`."],"follow_up_or_amendments":["No amendments requested for the CO2 exchange implementation itself.","If repo-wide validation is required before merge, rerun `cargo clippy -q -p tank_core --tests -- -D warnings` after cleaning or fixing the unrelated `crates/tank_core/tests/shrimp_population.rs` warning.","If a full package-green signal is required, resolve the existing unrelated `budget_helpers` failure and rerun `cargo test -q -p tank_core`."],"outcome":"conditionally_approved"}